pretraining: provenance and licences

Files ported or transcribed from upstream code name, in their header, the upstream file and
commit they come from.

- h12_train (branch supermimic, commit b175f1c) is this repository's own code and under its
  terms. Transcribed from it: pretraining/constants.py (src/h12_train/robot/h12_constants.py,
  src/h12_train/tasks.py and the joint ranges of src/h12_train/robot/xmls/h1_2_magpie.xml); the fps and joint-name checks of
  pretraining/motions.py (src/h12_train/scripts/motion_files.py); the env composition of
  pretraining/tasks/track_env_cfg.py (src/h12_train/tasks.py: h12_flat_tracking_env_cfg, apply_gencoord,
  h12_sensor_actor_group); pretraining/marl/{actors,config,learner,representation,rewards,runner,runs,wm_env}.py
  (src/h12_train/marl/ at the same paths, stage 1 only; the stage-1 goal and tool-frame helpers of
  src/h12_train/marl/goals.py in pretraining/marl/{rewards,wm_env}.py) and the stage-1 cases of
  pretraining/tests/test_two_agent.py (tests/{test_two_agent,test_runs}.py).
- SuperMimic (HybridRobotics, commit 7e94b07): Apache License 2.0. Ported from it:
  pretraining/supermimic/goal_window.py (goal-window constants and helpers of src/supermimic/representations.py,
  quat_to_rot6d of src/supermimic/utils/helpers.py); the full-state and goal terms of
  pretraining/tasks/observations.py and the groups of pretraining/tasks/track_env_cfg.py
  (src/supermimic/tasks/env_cfgs.py); pretraining/supermimic/{models,replay_buffer,representations (GenCoord only),
  sim_context}.py, tasks/task_spec.py, learners/{learner_utils,policy_learner,wm_learner}.py, envs/{world_model_env,motion_tracking_env}.py,
  runners/reset_sampling.py, runners/base_runner.py (BaseRunnerCfg, WorldModel, build_world_model, Ratio, BaseRunner
  of src/supermimic/runners/supermimic_runner.py) and utils/{helpers,gencoord_helpers,tracking_reward,logger,
  wandb_artifacts}.py, from the same paths under src/supermimic/.
- mjlab (HybridRobotics' fork mjlab_research, commit 6ea3e57): Apache License 2.0. Ported from it:
  pretraining/kinematics.py (src/mjlab/utils/forward_kinematics.py, its interface), pretraining/tasks/
  (commands.py, metrics.py, rewards.py, terminations.py and the tracking terms of observations.py from
  src/mjlab/tasks/tracking/mdp/; events.py from src/mjlab/envs/mdp/dr/{geom,joint}.py; track_env_cfg.py from
  src/mjlab/tasks/tracking/tracking_env_cfg.py), pretraining/motions.py
  (MotionLoader, with body_state, of src/mjlab/tasks/tracking/mdp/commands.py), EnvAdapter of
  pretraining/supermimic/runners/base_runner.py (RslRlVecEnvWrapper of src/mjlab/rl/vecenv_wrapper.py) and pretraining/math.py
  (src/mjlab/utils/lab_api/math.py, itself Isaac Lab's isaaclab/utils/math.py, BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c)
  2022-2025 The Isaac Lab Project Developers).
- PyTorch (2.15.0): BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. Transcribed from it:
  pretraining/supermimic/learners/muon.py (torch/optim/_muon.py, the Muon optimizer, absent from torch < 2.9).

The robot model (main's h1_2_magpie USD, from the Correll Lab's CL_Assets and Unitree
Robotics' H1-2 description) is used from main, not copied; their terms govern it.
